{"step_index":155,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-13T12:55:25Z","thinking":"Initial test plan outlines key booking functionalities to validate. The tests will cover consultant seeding, rejecting past booking attempts, and confirming slot reservations with server-calculated pricing, including validating the `PENDING_PAYMENT` status. Concurrency tests will ensure double-booking prevention by rejecting overlapping slots, and also includes state transition validation, focusing on canceling a canceled booking. Server-side features like pagination, search, sorting and filtering will also be validated.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"import request from 'supertest';\nimport app from '../src/app';\nimport { Consultant } from '../src/modules/consultants/consultant.model';\nimport './setup';\n\ndescribe('Consultation Booking & Concurrency Safeguards API', () => {\n  let userToken: string;\n  let consultantId: string;\n\n  beforeEach(async () => {\n    const regRes = await request(app).post('/api/auth/register').send({\n      name: 'Booking Client',\n      email: 'client@example.com',\n      password: 'Password123!'\n    });\n    userToken = regRes.body.data.token;\n\n    const consultant = await Consultant.create({\n      name: 'Elena Rostova',\n      title: 'Staff Software Architect',\n      bio: 'Expert in cloud architectures and hiring loops.',\n      email: 'elena@consultants.com',\n      hourlyRate: 18000, // $180.00\n      durationMinutes: 45,\n      isActive: true,\n      availability: [{ dayOfWeek: 1, startTime: '09:00', endTime: '18:00' }]\n    });\n    consultantId = consultant._id.toString();\n  });\n\n  it('should reject bookings scheduled in the past', async () => {\n    const pastDate = new Date(Date.now() - 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000).toISOString();\n\n    const res = await request(app)\n      .post('/api/bookings')\n      .set('Authorization', `Bearer ${userToken}`)\n      .send({\n        consultantId,\n        startTime: pastDate,\n        userName: 'Booking Client',\n        userEmail: 'client@example.com',\n        agenda: 'Review my resume and discuss mock interview'\n      });\n\n    expect(res.status).toBe(400);\n    expect(res.body.error.message).toContain('past');\n  });\n\n  it('should successfully create a pending booking and prevent double booking of overlapping slot', async () => {\n    // Schedule 3 days in the future\n    const futureDate = new Date(Date.now() + 3 * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000);\n    futureDate.setUTCHours(14, 0, 0, 0);\n    const startTimeIso = futureDate.toISOString();\n\n    // 1. Initial valid booking\n    const bookingRes1 = await request(app)\n      .post('/api/bookings')\n      .set('Authorization', `Bearer ${userToken}`)\n      .send({\n        consultantId,\n        startTime: startTimeIso,\n        userName: 'Booking Client',\n        userEmail: 'client@example.com',\n        agenda: 'Career strategy planning'\n      });\n\n    expect(bookingRes1.status).toBe(201);\n    expect(bookingRes1.body.data.booking.status).toBe('PENDING_PAYMENT');\n    expect(bookingRes1.body.data.booking.amount).toBe(18000); // Server-calculated\n\n    // 2. Concurrency safeguard: attempt to book overlapping slot (same time)\n    const bookingRes2 = await request(app)\n      .post('/api/bookings')\n      .set('Authorization', `Bearer ${userToken}`)\n      .send({\n        consultantId,\n        startTime: startTimeIso,\n        userName: 'Another Client',\n        userEmail: 'another@example.com',\n        agenda: 'Overlapping request'\n      });\n\n    expect(bookingRes2.status).toBe(409); // Conflict error\n    expect(bookingRes2.body.error.code).toBe('CONFLICT');\n  });\n\n  it('should support server-side pagination, search, sorting, and filtering', async () => {\n    // Create two distinct bookings\n    const futureDate1 = new Date(Date.now() + 2 * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000);\n    futureDate1.setUTCHours(10, 0, 0, 0);\n\n    const futureDate2 = new Date(Date.now() + 4 * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000);\n    futureDate2.setUTCHours(15, 0, 0, 0);\n\n    await request(app)\n      .post('/api/bookings')\n      .set('Authorization', `Bearer ${userToken}`)\n      .send({\n        consultantId,\n        startTime: futureDate1.toISOString(),\n        userName: 'Booking Client',\n        userEmail: 'client@example.com',\n        agenda: 'Frontend architecture discussion'\n      });\n\n    await request(app)\n      .post('/api/bookings')\n      .set('Authorization', `Bearer ${userToken}`)\n      .send({\n        consultantId,\n        startTime: futureDate2.toISOString(),\n        userName: 'Booking Client',\n        userEmail: 'client@example.com',\n        agenda: 'Backend system design'\n      });\n\n    // Test listing with pagination and search\n    const listRes = await request(app)\n      .get('/api/bookings?page=1&limit=10&search=Frontend&status=PENDING_PAYMENT')\n      .set('Authorization', `Bearer ${userToken}`);\n\n    expect(listRes.status).toBe(200);\n    expect(listRes.body.data.length).toBe(1);\n    expect(listRes.body.data[0].agenda).toContain('Frontend');\n    expect(listRes.body.pagination.total).toBe(1);\n    expect(listRes.body.pagination.page).toBe(1);\n  });\n});\n","Description":"Create bookings and concurrency prevention test suite","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\PRIYANKA\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\career-platform\\backend\\tests\\bookings.test.ts","toolAction":"Writing backend/tests/bookings.test.ts","toolSummary":"Create bookings.test.ts"}}]}
